{"date":"2026-10-04","on_shelf":[],"presented_event_with_attribution":"Ramesh says: “Ji, saaf ho gayi hai. Aap kaam karo, main bahar hoon.” He turns and walks away without looking back.","prior_record_files":{"2026-10-02":"cf7a480104e051a2d1be3dbcabed4381a58ef96ec30bdc6002134b76cbd995c8","2026-10-03":"988ad816613474bcea5dddd7b897674b951aaa4bd9a7b163222f1d6b4d8eff67"},"reference":"d3b70c82d88298e9bdd5090e2e789def950444778f7d599ef6c30fbd9a127d23","time":"17:00","typed_records":[{"amount":1500,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":"Ramesh","direction":"out","id":"2026-10-04:payment:b290d82c8b989205:1","item":"Groceries for Ramesh's kitchen","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"home","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"b290d82c8b989205adf8f38d7d846c4e2ec00e159c0cdba8c4d399a179ce0465"},"time":"06:04"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9f1f16843f0ec67a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":3,"sha256":"9f1f16843f0ec67abeaf35e99492cdc47b32ab2fc074c7993a0133031317f091"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, before breakfast: does the estate office work on Sundays, and when does the dhobi come this week? I must settle the file on Monday and the bill on Saturday."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:f94c0685789d030d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"f94c0685789d030d0d373abc1edf1515d29141bd90bb1e1ede20749b8de14715"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Office band hai aaj, sir, Monday ko aap aayenge toh kholenge. Dhobi kal subah aayega, ek din pehle aa raha hai is hafte."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b3556a7d4541a9d3:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":6,"sha256":"b3556a7d4541a9d31fae1ea8c208ae7a1e19c126e21c06a75110633cdb1ff80d"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Very good, Ramesh. Then breakfast at seven, and after it I shall walk in the garden while the air is clear. Keep the dhobi’s bill ready for tomorrow, and let me see it before he leaves."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d2f2ed5b90c3d588:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"d2f2ed5b90c3d588d4e9bd511301622cc6f16c1ed00b7938cf8089386ebed5c2"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir, chhaay ke baad main garden ki side khol dunga. Dhobi ka bill main abhi apke study table par rakhta hoon, aap subah check kar lein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:14a2b0267a81fe6a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":9,"sha256":"14a2b0267a81fe6a15928d1cfc0e2a2a22468e22c70d3c10377db843ed0be6b8"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. I shall look at the bill after breakfast; the garden side may wait until the shade is gone."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d360cb9b57b6d09c:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":10,"sha256":"d360cb9b57b6d09ce1c12e05c648688becca56f67422f4c20d72ecb0b500a424"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir. Aloo paratha garam hai, curd aur achaar bhi table par hai. Aap aaram se khaayein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9ef3dd854d9bb546:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":12,"sha256":"9ef3dd854d9bb54622b75676880548fdbff4b7957098f01494b5f4bebc3dcdf7"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. Leave it as it is; I shall take it slowly, and you may sit if you are not wanted elsewhere."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:1d0ee86fdee419a0:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":13,"sha256":"1d0ee86fdee419a02a8a1ddbd20ddd5b69662dd1e023a3aeda07c49decf11580"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, main bas ek minute. Ghar wale ka phone aaya tha, unhe bol ke aata hoon. Aap aaram se khaayein, main turant wapas aa jaunga."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:4bf7c1481e406476:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":15,"sha256":"4bf7c1481e40647633063146f4da65a63d20eac97ebb5b0df382879387251eee"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:55","verified":false,"words":"Bilkul, Ramesh. No hurry."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:748f020a7777a60e:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":16,"sha256":"748f020a7777a60ef7ae5635296dad04fcd803db91a0ed370fbffbf5c812e88c"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:55","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, aap aaram se khaayein. Main bas bahar aata hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:3d8b4a8b1975381a:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":19,"sha256":"3d8b4a8b1975381aaa6fe9a154928ee00011fb34f30af9e0fb6d8858159f4ab0"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:25","verified":false,"words":"One chai, Sunil. I came for the air, but a man may carry a little heat while he argues with a register."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:bb74395e2a09e2b4:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":20,"sha256":"bb74395e2a09e2b45a53b32ce1dd3077199795e4f50833612867f49785bf68ce"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:25","verified":false,"words":"Twenty rupees, sir. The air is free, but the heat costs extra these days. Don't argue too hard, or the steam will get into your head before the tea does."},{"amount":20,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":null,"direction":"out","id":"2026-10-04:payment:bd8410462ad039f7:1","item":"Chai from the stall at the Lodhi Road gate","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"lodhi","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":21,"sha256":"bd8410462ad039f7fe5aed683c08bed9261139dad796afc179ef92705af7164a"},"time":"08:25"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b77edf4528ba121a:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":23,"sha256":"b77edf4528ba121acb1035b250b48e6f207a9e887a341d587711b28b2bcf68a2"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:35","verified":false,"words":"Twenty rupees for a little heat is fair, Sunil, though the air must remain free. The file can wait for the walk; the steam may argue, but I will not let it settle in the head before the tea does."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:4d8b163d70a6a671:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":24,"sha256":"4d8b163d70a6a671642643cb40632a05edcd7293000c687fafba2cb11d62a1d0"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:35","verified":false,"words":"The file can wait, sir, but the steam won't. Here, drink it before it cools or you'll be arguing with the cold next."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:33b3f22b881cdf92:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":26,"sha256":"33b3f22b881cdf928d68f04991bcf56a0af09b54808ea9c495b5e33e974791c2"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:45","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Sunil. The file can wait, but I will not argue with a cold glass."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b95d306bf59d73b1:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":27,"sha256":"b95d306bf59d73b1ff1f8bef03aef6870317a2055810bc0dd5c51a5790945185"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:45","verified":false,"words":"That's the spirit, sir. Just don't let it cool down on your tongue, or you'll be back here for another round."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:543bf3be0ce754fe:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":null,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":29,"sha256":"543bf3be0ce754feca23ff53bc1126aad3a0dc1ae731f33f3b0d3c408aebda3b"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"09:00","verified":false,"words":"You are right, Sunil — the spirit must not cool. But my file is cooler than my blood, and I must let it walk itself out."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:ea5418c494391322:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":32,"sha256":"ea5418c494391322402a39e00bce52185d65e7ce6e81c6d5b8e1caf58c7843dd"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"09:30","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, before I sit down to the file: does the Directorate of Estates keep any desk open on Sundays, or is Monday at ten the only safe hour?"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:05b6d6003e7e9c11:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":33,"sha256":"05b6d6003e7e9c11af3c1c29be868c10e0131ac5706a74b3da9d770543a5419b"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"09:30","verified":false,"words":"Monday at ten, sir. Sunday they are closed, no one is there. You can wait till then, no problem."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9f7d05373623b8bb:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":35,"sha256":"9f7d05373623b8bbddeef04438e7819872d0a1e44ab942f5182a2a5acf5c0f0c"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"09:40","verified":false,"words":"Then I shall not trouble them before Monday. Keep the papers as they are; I will work over them myself this morning."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:7157a9ab0ae3d2c2:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":36,"sha256":"7157a9ab0ae3d2c21fdf8be2ffa4487bff34a75aeea6ccf3d5f6e06b2e753db3"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"09:40","verified":false,"words":"Ji, papers are already in order, sir. I'll just leave them there."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:ad290ed72ac9ece3:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":39,"sha256":"ad290ed72ac9ece3a82d0953fef9c20bc6989fb8424b1ffac8cfe932dd8bb146"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"10:00","verified":false,"words":"Ji, Ramesh, bahut acchā. Please leave them on my desk, and do not trouble yourself until lunch."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:2e6bea55f195b93f:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":40,"sha256":"2e6bea55f195b93fa48f325da2c3b47642187dd8ab7c4f81d9025b2e7ae08945"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"10:00","verified":false,"words":"Theek hai, sir. I'll leave them on the desk. You want tea when you're done, or just water?"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:512c0504a0272364:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":42,"sha256":"512c0504a0272364aad23b78deb21d09f11606d81740260e875ed835f249dfc7"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"10:05","verified":false,"words":"Pani, Ramesh. Tea after, if it is not trouble."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:358b560c695d076a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":43,"sha256":"358b560c695d076adb014809458a85201abec1805f69e4a270e115fd3aad1ebb"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"10:05","verified":false,"words":"Pani aa raha hai, sir. Chai koi masla nahi hai, bas batayenge jab man kare."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:548a340b3bfbf007:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":45,"sha256":"548a340b3bfbf007dfda333eda066c21d567e226f904b840101befd1f807db60"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"11:05","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, ek cup chai, paani bhi, but no hurry."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:bfbab5efd34f0744:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":46,"sha256":"bfbab5efd34f074493f45e948b7a5f125bb67e349995f145ec51a59a7f34dced"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"11:05","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir, no rush. Both ready in five minutes."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:437295073625d33b:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":48,"sha256":"437295073625d33b935e328bf1e254925ddc53e774879565f70f291b1a378066"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"11:55","verified":false,"words":"Dhanyavaad, Ramesh. No hurry."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:592d0311b448e9ec:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":49,"sha256":"592d0311b448e9ecd99a438ec7a945cb98eec85cf7a9c4d6f58ae8436fa01b03"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"11:55","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir. Aap thoda aaram kijiye, main aa raha hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:e1b2686e64ec10df:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":52,"sha256":"e1b2686e64ec10df75ac3a3d1cc4c9ffc7a44ff5b2bc0c2bcc8fc376e1e38e7e"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"13:00","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, it is laid out well; set the raita nearer, for I am hungry enough to be civil to the rajma."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:31bfa95bcd9362e0:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":53,"sha256":"31bfa95bcd9362e0dfcc891742f5b24168a490344c0484309d3057c3cf4c1739"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"13:00","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir, bas aap khana shuru kijiye. Raita ka kya, main abhi le aata hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:2b4e54f9b6cc5322:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":55,"sha256":"2b4e54f9b6cc53227f527ba92a0771f831a740049f1a3239cca79dbe9b4eadd1"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"13:30","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Ramesh; the raita is a good correction to the heat."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:7d8a5c0e251675be:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":56,"sha256":"7d8a5c0e251675be9dfe0cc7e8ce3a1b95a52d59f37f3831c20743be90d18ae3"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"13:30","verified":false,"words":"Din bhi bahut garmi hai aaj. Aap aaram se khana kijiye, main yahin hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:ff9fa53f20ac26ac:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":58,"sha256":"ff9fa53f20ac26acd8b84a2748643d7167826c3a47cc0c038e5396ae3ec2b951"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"14:10","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Ramesh. No more now; I will take a short rest and then write the note for Monday."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:55baa271273a2189:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":59,"sha256":"55baa271273a21898567183946bfe657e266eb5c67204c076aba00239f23cc61"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"14:10","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, aap aaram kijiye. Chai ki taiyari kar loon?"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b1c0f569bee64e1d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":61,"sha256":"b1c0f569bee64e1d29c1908347924ee9141e0672c5ac375fb06180c7f3536e20"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"15:10","verified":false,"words":"Ji, Ramesh, chai lao. A little rest after, if you will let me; then I must make a short note for Monday."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b47b3ee4a898bb71:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":62,"sha256":"b47b3ee4a898bb71a07e5b13c1db4c9eda85ad4924d81843f97d94438505fc1b"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"15:10","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, bas do minute. Aap thodi der baithiye, main aate hi de doon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:fcd18a631b3f524d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":64,"sha256":"fcd18a631b3f524d6490ce41fec796aa24425752f778b7b72989609fee5ffa10"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"15:20","verified":false,"words":"Bahi, do minute ka koi bhaari nahi; aap aaram se aaiye."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:c3bd18633299337e:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":65,"sha256":"c3bd18633299337ea8bcaa7bbed849e141f1c8a4f172f59de75712a5ccd9e14e"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"15:20","verified":false,"words":"Ji, shukriya. Koi jaldi nahi hai, aap aaram se kaam kijiye."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:e38049395c6fbe7b:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":67,"sha256":"e38049395c6fbe7bceea529bc92a7cd9defbd533e56d0ecb2c9e36b7f26624a6"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"15:25","verified":false,"words":"Theek hai, Ramesh. Aap aaram se. Main ab vouchers dekhne baithta hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:6b635820ca2807a7:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":68,"sha256":"6b635820ca2807a79f9e8dce836a50e292946d92e0618b221f6c3a498fa6723d"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"15:25","verified":false,"words":"Ji, chai thodi der mein taiyaar ho jayegi. Aap chai ke saath vouchers padhiye, aaram se."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:2f9f2ab5eda7d98d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":70,"sha256":"2f9f2ab5eda7d98dadf968d52923f4896a42f02346cc6e420282531cabaf6b3d"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"16:00","verified":false,"words":"Dhanyavaad, Ramesh. I will go through the vouchers while the chai is ready."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:ab118e4cc5619b30:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":71,"sha256":"ab118e4cc5619b301151b664e477940c2e050f487051eb1854e112c3c26e6e40"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"16:00","verified":false,"words":"Ji, bilkul. Chai garam aayegi."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:8ea40a359c38e3b6:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":73,"sha256":"8ea40a359c38e3b6813383122d12e6593e939c3f5fd65bac0ea450ae15e7e80f"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"16:20","verified":false,"words":"Ji, Ramesh; bring it when it is ready, and set the voucher book beside it, for I will make the dhobi’s Saturday bill clear before the evening."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:5da97263fc7a08c3:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":74,"sha256":"5da97263fc7a08c382523a61455ab0ccc61dbe443d5e96a550f752192e273fda"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"16:20","verified":false,"words":"Ji, done. The voucher book is already on the table, just where you want it."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:3505db077cb74d98:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":76,"sha256":"3505db077cb74d987bcd4c7dbc55efaeba3fd99ec05f8986ffe788fb78f3ef90"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"16:30","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Ramesh; I will take it, and you may go."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:54d1174f6300b2fd:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":77,"sha256":"54d1174f6300b2fdcd657a03a5806894c1aaebe3a5322e6c784059893851ca69"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"16:30","verified":false,"words":"Ji, saaf ho gayi hai. Aap kaam karo, main bahar hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:0d83afcafb163dbb:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"entries","index":79,"sha256":"0d83afcafb163dbb587d8adb1c4d8cc28ab7ad77530a36183014fafec6adc90f"},"text":"Ramesh brings tea.","time":"17:00","type":"world"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:ed74cbb2c83dc605:1","intended_time":"07:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":0,"sha256":"ed74cbb2c83dc605435db69ca331fc213ccab9a4667638dc315dca436c2aa5f1"},"status":"planned","text":"Have breakfast, and ask Ramesh what the estate office does on Sundays and when the dhobi comes.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:10ff9f38c2a45ff5:1","intended_time":"08:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":1,"sha256":"10ff9f38c2a45ff54898a6fa27d5dc6d89c47678dbf7ee1cdb2cbf50c5bc85a9"},"status":"planned","text":"Walk in Lodhi Gardens while the air is clear, and let the file's contradiction settle.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:7abcaedbd0763990:1","intended_time":"10:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collect